Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.95,0:00:20.06,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Goblins can be dangerous in groups,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:23.15,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,but I can use the layout of the dungeon \Nto force them into one-on-one fights,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.15,0:00:24.29,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,where they're helpless against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.48,0:00:31.67,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I existential evolved into a ghoul, \Nand I've got some muscle now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.67,0:00:34.43,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm much more agile than \NI was as a skeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.89,0:00:38.29,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,And the biggest surprise was \Nthat my mana, spirit energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.29,0:00:40.12,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,and divinity have all increased.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.38,0:00:45.83,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Now I can strengthen not \Nonly myself, but my sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.54,0:01:00.93,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Maybe... I'm even stronger \Nnow than I was as a human!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.67,0:02:42.97,Title,Rentt,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord2\fs17\c&H908A88&\3c&H000000&\pos(486.223,278)}The Rookie and\N the Veteran
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.95,0:03:06.27,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's been so long since I've seen a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.19,0:03:10.55,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,No, I can't go out there like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.10,0:03:14.73,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm a ghoul. She'd either \Ntry to kill me or run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.43,0:03:18.01,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,So I'll just watch from a distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.70,0:03:22.79,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm so jealous she gets to be human.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.54,0:03:26.54,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I don't recognize her. Is she a rookie?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.38,0:03:31.59,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I know pretty much every \Nadventurer in Maalt, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.59,0:03:35.57,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,The reason I know them is because \Nadventurers can be a rough crowd,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.57,0:03:38.16,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,and a lot of them will make \Nfun of weaklings like me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.16,0:03:41.19,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,or try to get us to take the \Nfall for something they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.66,0:03:46.42,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Knowing their abilities and who \Ntheir friends are can help a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.95,0:03:52.06,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Having fewer bad guys around made the \Nadventurers in Maalt a lot better than most.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.59,0:03:55.86,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,And the guild seems to like having me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.86,0:03:59.05,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,As weak as I am, hasn't \Ntold me I need to retire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.22,0:04:11.49,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,That way leads to...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.94,0:04:29.00,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,She's received proper training.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.66,0:04:33.47,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,But she's weak, so she needs \Nto land a lot of hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.47,0:04:36.23,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,She's probably planning on taking her \Ntime and dodging while she defeats it...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.50,0:04:40.55,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,But she's not watching \Nher surroundings at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.30,0:04:49.47,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,I'm going to become a real adventurer!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.27,0:04:53.20,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,I won't let a skeleton beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:03.57,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I guess I've got no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.28,0:05:09.25,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,A ghoul?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.90,0:05:16.50,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Come on... The enemy just turned \Nits back to you! Attack it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.81,0:05:19.40,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,No, I guess she's too stunned \Nto think about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.95,0:05:29.26,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.17,0:05:32.47,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.99,0:05:35.62,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're safe...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.06,0:05:43.88,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,H-Hello... I'm R-Rentt...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.88,0:05:45.65,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Rentt!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.20,0:05:48.36,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Stay away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.36,0:05:51.72,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Please! Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.72,0:05:54.84,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm not your enemy...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.09,0:05:58.78,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,P-Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.25,0:06:01.77,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,It's... talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.77,0:06:03.73,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.73,0:06:05.84,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm Rentt...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.29,0:06:08.19,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,An adventurer...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.48,0:06:11.37,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,An adventurer? An adventurer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.37,0:06:12.79,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.79,0:06:15.39,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm an adventurer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.39,0:06:17.72,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,My name is Rentt!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.16,0:06:20.41,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Rendo?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.41,0:06:23.61,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Renro... Rentt!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.61,0:06:25.50,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Rentt!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.50,0:06:26.48,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.52,0:06:33.03,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,So, why do you look like that, Rentt?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.03,0:06:34.34,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Some kind of disguise?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.34,0:06:38.17,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,N-No! I died...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.17,0:06:41.47,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But... I'm alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.00,0:06:46.33,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Yes, you don't look like a normal monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.33,0:06:48.81,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Thank you for saving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.30,0:06:53.76,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Adventurers... look out for each other...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.40,0:06:56.85,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Um... I appreciate you saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.85,0:07:00.53,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,So... I hate to ask, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.53,0:07:02.10,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.10,0:07:05.10,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Can I go back?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.10,0:07:07.20,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,You're not going to kill me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.41,0:07:10.70,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I-I'm not going to kill you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.70,0:07:14.00,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But I want your help...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.42,0:07:15.41,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Help?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.41,0:07:19.61,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I want you... to buy me clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.13,0:07:21.83,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.27,0:07:25.54,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I want to go back to Maalt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.81,0:07:30.74,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Oh... so perhaps a robe \Nthat would hide your body?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.74,0:07:32.77,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.77,0:07:35.05,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,M-Money...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.73,0:07:42.55,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,If you... buy me those clothes... \Nyou can have the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.92,0:07:49.47,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.64,0:07:54.27,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,My name is Rina Rupaage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.27,0:07:57.16,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,As the daughter of a knight, \NI shall repay this debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.74,0:08:07.21,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Just wait for me, Rentt...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.58,0:08:12.92,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,She's pretty cautious around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.92,0:08:15.63,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,For an adventurer, that's \Nthe right way to be, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.03,0:08:18.75,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,A proper adventurer would report
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.75,0:08:23.40,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,something as strange as a ghoul \Nlike me to the guild immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.98,0:08:27.08,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,But I don't think she'll betray me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.69,0:08:33.12,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Even if I'm wrong, though, I'll cross \Nthat bridge when I come to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.21,0:08:41.85,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.80,0:08:44.13,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Aren't you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.51,0:08:50.83,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,You don't look hurt. I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.83,0:08:55.10,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I was worried because you didn't \Ncome back after sunset.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.10,0:08:57.86,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Well, a lot happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.41,0:09:02.15,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,There's something I want \Nto ask you, actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.42,0:09:13.03,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I can't believe it... but I'm a lot \Nstronger than I was as a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.62,0:09:15.52,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's not just that I'm stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.52,0:09:18.65,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,My body moves exactly how I want it to!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.91,0:09:25.26,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,And I think my vision's better, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.26,0:09:28.96,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,No, this is probably just what \Nthey call combat intuition.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.31,0:09:31.99,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Something you can't learn \Nfrom training or studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.99,0:09:35.97,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,So this is how the world looked to all \Nthe adventurers that succeeded...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.61,0:09:40.79,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,To think I only got the power I wanted \Nmost after I ended up in this body...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.72,0:09:43.69,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Rentt?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.69,0:09:46.50,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Rentt, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.62,0:09:52.76,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Rentt?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.79,0:09:57.32,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,S-She really came back...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.32,0:09:59.16,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Rentt!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.16,0:10:06.42,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Um... you're Rentt, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.42,0:10:09.47,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Or are you another ghoul, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.47,0:10:10.95,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm Rentt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.43,0:10:16.61,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Ghouls don't show up on the \Nearly levels like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.61,0:10:18.50,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.55,0:10:22.76,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,I feel like you've gotten a \Nlittle better at talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.23,0:10:25.96,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I-I practiced...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.29,0:10:28.93,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,G-Great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.93,0:10:33.28,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Oh, right. This is what you \Nasked for and your change.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.32,0:10:45.50,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,S-Sorry... I'm still a little scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.85,0:10:49.55,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Give me a little more time... Just a \Nlittle more time until I get used to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.55,0:10:52.83,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,No, it's fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.17,0:10:56.76,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Now, may I look at the clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.76,0:10:59.14,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Of course! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.83,0:11:07.61,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.61,0:11:09.64,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Do you like them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.64,0:11:11.09,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.47,0:11:14.31,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,A plain color that nobody \Nwould give a second glance,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.31,0:11:18.32,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,and a robe that conceals the whole body, \Nlike a mage would wear! Wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.70,0:11:21.66,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.52,0:11:25.50,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,I brought other things I \Nthought you might need.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.50,0:11:31.25,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,I just got to Maalt, so I had someone \Nin the guild show me the best shops.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.53,0:11:39.30,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,It felt like a bad idea to let \Nanyone see your arms or legs...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.94,0:11:44.23,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,What a kind, considerate girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.94,0:11:49.42,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I feel like I could cry! \NExcept I physically can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.42,0:11:50.83,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Rentt?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.83,0:11:53.29,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.29,0:11:55.26,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'll try them on right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.49,0:12:03.46,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's easier to move in this than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.05,0:12:08.53,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I lose some visibility, but it would be \Neasy enough to fight a monster or two...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.87,0:12:10.02,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,How do you like them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.32,0:12:11.99,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,They're perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.99,0:12:13.59,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.59,0:12:18.59,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,You look pretty imposing, \Ntoo. Almost like a wight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.29,0:12:24.17,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I stand out too much...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.35,0:12:26.97,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I guess that won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.97,0:12:31.10,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Um, how about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.39,0:12:33.36,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.67,0:12:38.61,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,I thought it might be a bad idea for you to try to\Ngo into town with your face looking like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.22,0:12:41.59,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.21,0:12:55.37,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,When I first saw you, I thought \Nyou were a rare or named monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.69,0:13:01.58,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,A special type of monster, \Nhuh? You may be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.14,0:13:09.79,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,You look great!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.51,0:13:15.50,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I can't get it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.28,0:13:24.88,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,No luck...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.88,0:13:26.07,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.43,0:13:30.05,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,I saw it at a market stall and \Ncouldn't stop thinking about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.05,0:13:33.03,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,But looking back, it did \Nseem a little suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.03,0:13:37.46,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,A market stall? Not a place \Nintroduced by the guild?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.46,0:13:40.76,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,It wasn't. The mask was the one thing \NI bought at that market stall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.76,0:13:43.61,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,It was shockingly cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.61,0:13:45.07,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,How much?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.07,0:13:46.81,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Three coppers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.44,0:13:49.89,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,That's three loaves of bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.49,0:13:53.21,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's just too cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.64,0:14:00.06,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,I did check for curses! And nothing \Nhappened when I touched it...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.31,0:14:03.30,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,A curse that activates \Nwhen you put it on, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.30,0:14:05.78,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I really do have the worst luck...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.48,0:14:08.47,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Let me try this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.56,0:14:12.53,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,You can use divinity?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.78,0:14:15.67,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Just a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.99,0:14:21.06,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Now that I have more divinity, I might \Nbe able to break a basic curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.97,0:14:28.40,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm out of energy...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.04,0:14:30.68,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,No luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.68,0:14:34.56,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry for bringing you a cursed item!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.56,0:14:36.45,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.45,0:14:38.83,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,But it's all my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.49,0:14:44.65,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Right now, I need to\Nhide my face anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.65,0:14:47.84,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It responded to the divinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.84,0:14:53.44,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I just need to save up money and ask \Na powerful cleric to break the curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.75,0:14:56.41,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,So don't worry about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.02,0:14:59.67,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.52,0:15:04.51,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.04,0:15:07.60,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,I can tell...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.06,0:15:11.16,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,you're not a bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.57,0:15:14.88,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,So I'm not scared anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.79,0:15:18.43,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,I'm... not scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.78,0:15:24.39,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.23,0:15:32.32,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But you don't have to force yourself... \Nuntil the day when you really are used to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.32,0:15:35.53,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,It won't take long at all! \NIt won't! I'm sure of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.24,0:15:41.68,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Now Rentt, let's head back to Maalt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.77,0:15:52.50,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,I registered as an adventurer \Nin the capital city guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.50,0:15:56.21,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,But there are a lot of famous \Nadventurers there...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.21,0:15:59.58,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Since there weren't any \Njobs for rookies like me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.58,0:16:01.40,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,they recommended I come to Maalt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.40,0:16:03.80,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,There are two labyrinths \Nclose by, for one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.80,0:16:05.89,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,A good choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.41,0:16:10.40,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But I'm surprised you were willing to \Ncome all the way out to the countryside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.97,0:16:14.59,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,I wanted to see the outside \Nworld, and more than anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.59,0:16:17.91,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,I want to get stronger and become \Na full-fledged adventurer fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.11,0:16:24.87,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel. But it's better \Nfor an adventurer to be a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.31,0:16:28.08,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You've only got one life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.07,0:16:32.04,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.34,0:16:35.75,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Guys like me are pretty rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.98,0:16:55.55,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.55,0:16:58.86,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,A lot of people here know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.86,0:17:02.33,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,They'll know something's \Nwrong if I show my ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.88,0:17:05.58,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Then shall we go in from a different gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.58,0:17:10.02,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yes. One that's not normally used.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.02,0:17:13.93,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,All right. We'll head to the west gate, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.90,0:17:18.29,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Rina, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.73,0:17:24.47,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I only made it this far thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.47,0:17:27.59,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,No, don't act like we're saying goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.81,0:17:32.10,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,I'll help you as much as I can until \Nwe get in town. No, even after that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.53,0:17:37.86,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yes, I do need someone to help me. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.92,0:17:44.48,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm a monster. If you help me get \Ninside, you'll be a criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.66,0:17:50.15,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You might lose your adventurer's license.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.73,0:17:54.65,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I don't want to cause trouble for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.54,0:17:57.63,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.16,0:18:01.47,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,If I hadn't met you, I'd be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.55,0:18:08.58,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,So at least once, I think it's okay \Nfor me to risk my life for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.95,0:18:11.33,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Now let's go, Rentt!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.15,0:18:16.15,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,We're about to close the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.44,0:18:17.47,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.68,0:18:21.22,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,A man and a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.22,0:18:22.74,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Show us your IDs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.62,0:18:26.45,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Adventurers?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.45,0:18:30.73,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Rentt Faina the bronze-class, and \NRina Rupaage the iron-class, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.73,0:18:31.67,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.08,0:18:37.80,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,You've got quite an unusual appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.56,0:18:40.67,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.67,0:18:43.03,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Have you seen him before?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.42,0:18:45.42,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,You ever been to Maalt?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.39,0:18:49.50,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Let us see your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.67,0:18:55.35,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,I'm sorry... His mask is cursed, \Nand he can't take it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.35,0:18:56.39,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Cursed?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.39,0:18:58.07,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Is that why he talks weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.54,0:19:03.03,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,That's because he was horribly \Ninjured after fighting a monster..
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.49,0:19:11.91,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,He bought the mask to hide the \Nscars, and it was cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.91,0:19:14.15,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Now he can't take it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.15,0:19:15.80,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,That's awful luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.13,0:19:18.91,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Try to pull it off yourself, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.61,0:19:21.66,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,It's safe to touch!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.66,0:19:23.13,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,I've touched it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.03,0:19:26.06,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.24,0:19:31.74,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,{\an8}It really won't come off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.51,0:19:35.61,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,We need to donate a lot to the \Nchurch to have a cleric remove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.97,0:19:38.25,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,And we're having trouble \Nsaving up the money...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.25,0:19:39.70,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,That's rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.89,0:19:44.28,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Fine! You may pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.24,0:19:48.67,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Okay, next!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.24,0:19:51.28,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,We did it, Rentt!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.28,0:19:54.67,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's all... thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.92,0:19:56.38,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.83,0:19:59.50,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,I'm just repaying the debt I owe you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.91,0:20:05.38,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,What's the plan now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.11,0:20:09.37,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Huh? Rentt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.71,0:20:12.47,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Rentt? Rentt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.83,0:20:16.35,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Rentt? Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.85,0:20:17.85,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,She really is a good kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.34,0:20:21.34,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Her equipment's cheap, but \Nit's been well-maintained.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.34,0:20:24.09,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,She has a knack for swinging that \Nsword, and she's pretty smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.09,0:20:25.09,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Brave, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.61,0:20:29.62,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,She'll make a fine adventurer. I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.08,0:20:35.04,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,All the people I know with talent like \Nthat left me behind really fast...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.73,0:20:41.64,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. When I look a little \Nmore human, I'll come apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.41,0:20:49.67,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Now, it's hard to manipulate \Na kind girl like Rina...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.67,0:20:51.83,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,but I do need a human cooperator.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.53,0:20:56.93,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Somebody who's got a bit of a past, \Nand who can be trusted to keep secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.63,0:21:23.42,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Lorraine...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.91,0:21:27.42,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Lorraine... wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.93,0:21:29.75,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I said wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.71,0:21:33.44,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Let me sleep just a little more...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.18,0:21:38.40,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'll drop a book on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.10,0:21:43.24,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Please don't do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.99,0:21:50.35,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Rentt, you...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.71,0:21:55.24,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just a mask. \NDon't scare me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.33,0:22:04.14,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Rentt... What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.68,0:23:40.01,Title,Lorraine,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord2\fs28\c&H2B2C54&\3c&HC5E4F6&\pos(156.223,268)}The Undead Infiltrates the Town
